      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "ἔβην, ‘I went’\nἔ-βη-ν ‘I went’\nἔ-βη-ς ‘you (s.) ‘went’\nἔ-βη ‘he/she went’\nἔ-βη-μεν ‘we went’\nἔ-βη-τε ‘you (pl.) went’\nἔ-βη-σαν ‘they went’\nInfinitive\nβῆναι ‘to go’",
      "lang": "mixed",
